w, since we have an integral over the interval $[-1,1],$ which is symmetric about the origin, we can conclude that\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-1}^{1}10{t}^{3}({t}^{2}+1)\\,\\text{d}t=0.\n$$\n\n  \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n{\\text{proj}}_{{f}_{2}(t)}\\,g(t)=\\frac{0}{⟨{f}_{2}(t),{f}_{2}(t)⟩}\\cdot ({t}^{2}+1)=0.\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{S}\\,g(t) & ={\\text{proj}}_{{f}_{1}(t)}\\,g(t)+{\\text{proj}}_{{f}_{2}(t)}\\,g(t) \\\\  & =6t+0 \\\\  & =6t.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535510 true] [17592186352862 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352863 13194139535510 true] [17592186352862 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352864 13194139535510 true] [17592186352862 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352865 13194139535510 true] [17592186352862 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352866 13194139535510 true] [17592186352862 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352867 13194139535510 true] [17592186352862 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535510 true] [17592186352862 1041 "selection" 13194139535510 true] [17592186352862 1104 #edb/ref 17592186352866 13194139535510 true] [17592186352862 1110 #uuid "db39ad06-ef05-5b1f-bbce-49cb36e5b226" 13194139535510 true] [17592186352863 1034 "{t}^{2}-1" 13194139535510 true] [17592186352863 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535510 true] [17592186352863 1111 #uuid "2e7ceb57-2602-5de7-90ae-5ae6d6bea33d" 13194139535510 true] [17592186352864 1034 "10{t}^{3}+3t" 13194139535510 true] [17592186352864 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535510 true] [17592186352864 1111 #uuid "e5ea22ac-9ebf-520c-b2db-39a29c4be6de" 13194139535510 true] [17592186352865 1034 "{t}^{2}+6t+1" 13194139535510 true] [17592186352865 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535510 true] [17592186352865 1111 #uuid "3a029d30-65ce-5da7-898a-807f426293b6" 13194139535510 true] [17592186352866 1034 "6t" 13194139535510 true] [17592186352866 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535510 true] [17592186352866 1111 #uuid "ca0ba6b4-a699-5c70-9d70-11a98c6feee2" 13194139535510 true] [17592186352867 1034 "{t}^{2}+1" 13194139535510 true] [175921863528